{"vid":"kA75rDz6EFo","source":"kA75rDz6EFo.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":5.1,"txt":"I knew I wasn't going to college so I was looking for the trades and I found a new home basically"},{"t":13.7,"txt":"it's pretty cool, before I was doing this I was working at a freight company making about I want"},{"t":20.3,"txt":"to say $18 now I'm making $38 right now at my skill so big jump and then plus on top of that"},{"t":30.6,"txt":"I get health benefits I get dental you know the stuff that comes with being a boilermaker"},{"t":37.3,"txt":"obviously.I went to college for special ed and then I did that for six years but then when I was"},{"t":43.6,"txt":"teaching It's never enough so I bartended forever as well. before I got into the Union I was working"},{"t":49.7,"txt":"at a construction company making $12 an hour and just working my ass off then I got to the boiler"},{"t":58,"txt":"makers I mean things were totally different. I used to be hair stylist and I just got fed up"},{"t":63.7,"txt":"with it and I didn't want to go College I kind of wanted to be a welder so I went to welding school"},{"t":69.6,"txt":"we had this one girl come in she's like yeah I'm a boilermaker like I love it like everybody treats"},{"t":74.8,"txt":"me where like very fairly so go be a boilermaker so I came in one day and I applied and I got in"},{"t":81.2,"txt":"and I just I love it, be a boilermaker it's great like I love being a boilermaker I would not want"},{"t":86,"txt":"any other job. right out of high school I went to a welding Technical College and learned how"},{"t":92.9,"txt":"to weld and then I went down to local 69 they did uh welding classes to help try to get welders into"},{"t":100.4,"txt":"the apprenticeship and I was able to get into the apprenticeship pretty fast after graduating"},{"t":105.4,"txt":"high school I'm the first one in my family to do anything in the trades my dad's proud he's like"},{"t":110,"txt":"oh yeah my like she does this like she she works in boilers blast furnaces nuclear power plants we"},{"t":117.4,"txt":"learn something new every day being a boilmaker when you're on a job might be something new that"},{"t":121.7,"txt":"you've never done or you've done it different hundreds of times but at least every job I've been"},{"t":128.5,"txt":"on I've been learning something new and I I feel like I'm going to be learning something new every"},{"t":133.6,"txt":"every time I go on a job. a lot of the guys are really great they uh teach me lots they're always"},{"t":138.7,"txt":"trying to help me learn uh if I'm making mistakes they they stop me correct me and uh stop me from"},{"t":145.9,"txt":"making them in the future I haven't made the same mistakes twice yet. I love welding just because"},{"t":151.2,"txt":"it's me time it's you know you flip your mask down you just do you you focus right on that weld you"},{"t":156.8,"txt":"can kind of block out everything else that's going on and I enjoy it I enjoy seeing myself"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"improve and get better. yeah welding was exactly what I wanted something that I could do Hands-On"},{"t":166.4,"txt":"and something I can see a final result at the end of the day and it a career that I can build um"},{"t":172,"txt":"throughout the years. now as an apprentice stuff that I've been watching uh be done for a long time"},{"t":177.7,"txt":"now I'm able to actually get in there get get the tools and do the work. the fact that I know"},{"t":182.9,"txt":"how to do something and not just one part of that something you know when it comes to tanks I can"},{"t":192.9,"txt":"maintenance the tank I can um take it apart but I can also build it back up. I've got wonderful"},{"t":199.9,"txt":"crew that I love and respect I enjoy working with them I know that there's so much in this trade"},{"t":206,"txt":"that I've yet to learn to experience with but I am hopeful as my career continues I get to learn and"},{"t":215.6,"txt":"gain the knowledge that my predecessors have. you continue to learn something different every day"},{"t":221.1,"txt":"which is what I like I can never do that office setting type job and being able to just advance in"},{"t":227.1,"txt":"my career and keep gaining knowledge and with that knowledge like I get paid respectively for that as"},{"t":234,"txt":"well too. the border of maker provides my family with great benefits Insurance Dental Insurance a"},{"t":239.9,"txt":"retirement I get a vacation check my family's very very proud of that. outside of work I like"},{"t":245.7,"txt":"hang out with my friends family just like having fun I like traveling been on vacation a couple"},{"t":250.9,"txt":"times when I'm not working so it's nice to be financially stable to do that multiple times"},{"t":256.4,"txt":"a year. this is the first Union I've ever been in but it means security um they have great benefits"},{"t":262.7,"txt":"and they're they have my best interest in mind. my family we had time and no money our money and"},{"t":268.1,"txt":"no time with being a boilermaker it affords me both I can have time and money for my children"},{"t":275.2,"txt":"and we like that a lot I appreciate it. the apprenticeship is great I mean I would recommend"},{"t":281.4,"txt":"the apprenticeship over anything else that anybody could do because you don't come out here blind and"},{"t":287.8,"txt":"have to learn on the job necessarily you're going have the training , the skill, the knowledge on"},{"t":294.9,"txt":"what you're doing before you maybe ever even get to do it so uh program is a really great deal."}],"words":[{"t":5.08,"w":"I"},{"t":5.08,"w":"knew"},{"t":5.08,"w":"I"},{"t":5.08,"w":"wasn't"},{"t":5.08,"w":"going"},{"t":5.08,"w":"to"},{"t":5.08,"w":"college"},{"t":5.08,"w":"so"},{"t":5.08,"w":"I"},{"t":5.08,"w":"was"},{"t":5.08,"w":"looking"},{"t":5.08,"w":"for"},{"t":5.08,"w":"the"},{"t":5.08,"w":"trades"},{"t":5.08,"w":"and"},{"t":5.08,"w":"I"},{"t":5.08,"w":"found"},{"t":5.08,"w":"a"},{"t":5.08,"w":"new"},{"t":5.08,"w":"home"},{"t":5.08,